Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: canonicalization (validates ADR 0009)
Purpose:
    Apply Weisfeiler–Lehman canonicalization to every subgraph instance
    produced by ADR 0008's extraction on the ADR 0007 mixed graph.
    Group instances by canonical form ("pattern class"). Answer the
    follow-up question from ADR 0008's log: does pattern equivalence
    span different compound classes?

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0009 (Subgraph::canonicalize — WL-1 rank-based refinement,
    CanonicalForm = sorted edge list over stable labels).
    Source: v2/src/lib.rs at the commit implementing 0009.
    Runner: v2/examples/canonicalization.rs.

Command:
    cargo run --example canonicalization

